(This is really to the dev team, though I'm interested if anyone else
 approves...)

How about putting the current HP up on the action line?

The number of times now that I've been killed because I don't notice a
couple of heavy blows...  its mostly due to the fact the you're
looking at the action line saying `The xx hits. The xx misses. -- More--`
etc, and you don't realise that one of those blows was a doozy.  This
especially happens when you are surrounded, and one nasty blow gets
snuck in.

All it would take is:
`The Gnome misses.  The mumak hits.  The mumak misses --More--`
`The mumak misses.  The newt misses.  (HP:10)`

or some such, with the HP being tacked on there on the last of a
series of hits before its your turn.

(Note that in the above sequence it would be easy to not even notice
that the mumak hit once).

Waddaya reckon?

Ta,

